        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_055"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoederer, yes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius"
    },
    {
        "text": "I look forward to seeing what else you uncover.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Confessarius"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_victoria",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...*Sigh*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like it's house arrest for both of us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not like I never thought about it. And hey, it's better than I was expecting...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we were a little too naive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Which part was naive? The part where you thought you'd die, or the part where you thought the Regent didn't know?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "Both. He's been pulling the strings from the start.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not that I'm surprised... he's Theresis. We've all heard the stories about him and Theresa, the invincible forces of nature...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I guess in the course of the war, I forgot those stories... weren't just stories.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "So how do we warn W? What's going on with Reunion?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "We wasted so much time on the road. She might've already split with Talulah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "The other possibility is the show ends in Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wouldn't that be a bit too quick?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "It fits with the way W works. If Talulah's gonna destroy the Infected, W'll destroy Talulah first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sarkaz style. With extreme prejudice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's pretty upset over the death of a certain merc, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "She knows the score.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's out of room to hesitate any longer. Now she just needs to get into the right headspace to make a move.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that means we're left waiting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've got ways to fool the Regent's eyes. It'd be a crazy risky play, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've still got my own squad I can keep on 'standby.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Victoria's all over the place right now. They probably wouldn't catch the code.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, and it would have to pass by some real tricky spots controlled by the Regent... and on to Kazdel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kazdel?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "The battlefield ruins there haven't been touched in a long time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we eked out a living there for a good long time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "There was a communications station in an old bunker buried under those ruins. The tower made it look like it was destroyed, but everything down there still works.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on, that was a long time ago...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "How long have you been preparing this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "All done way back at the very beginning. Cost me a pretty penny too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh heh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh man... if they saw the look on your face right now, boy would they be surprised.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "For a while now, every time you came back from a battle, you were always deep in thought, like a kid who did something bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "I figured you'd just lost your will to fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nah, it was the opposite, actually. I finally realized what it was I had to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "How?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because I had no choice. It's kind of liberating, in a way?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "W must've said something to you before you left Chernobog.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does that sound like her? Laying all the cards on the table?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. She'd be a lot less of a pain if she did though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right that she came looking for me before I left the core city. She knew what we were going to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "She...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
