    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you put a price on the life of a merc?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure. Always have. Why even ask? You knew the answer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But who set the price?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The war itself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure... you got your battlefield honors, your victories, the glory you pull out of a hand-to-hand fight, all the things that raise your profile, that let everybody know what a useful tool you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "So boring.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that's all in the past. At least for us it is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...What do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Every Sarkaz merc should have a nice, clean price tag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we don't need anybody to slap it on. No oversight. They write their own price in the blood of the enemies of Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You... are you saying we should get everyone to leave Kazdel...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You look surprised. But like, they could choose for themselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does this sound weird?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not weird, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just give it some thought... think about what you could be doing in Kazdel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're talking about doing that right in front of Theresis, in broad daylight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You make it sound so bad. As if you don't have your own plans.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": ".......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Chill... you were my boss, Hoederer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'd better do it, or we'll have trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "keep": true,
        "amount": 0,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_victoria",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's a pretty good joke. The old hands at the Scar Market would laugh themselves into a coma.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "It certainly wouldn't make the committee happy. They'd be out a lotta money, and a lotta wasted brainpower.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not to mention all the people they killed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure enough... and the old hands there too... some of them are almost friends of ours...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "So what are you gonna do now? It's up to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well... I can't leave Londinium. Hell, I can't even leave this mansion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think it's up to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can do a lot as a 'Messenger.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Keep following Talulah's orders. Hoederer isn't coming back yet.' Should be good?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as that comms station still works, we'll hear back. And they'll get word to W.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know how to do this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't give me orders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Messenger"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_cher_3",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*... What a pain in the ass...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just when I decide to go after the dragon lady... What a time you picked.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get out here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The ruins of Chernobog weren't like those of Kazdel."
    },
    {
        "text": "There were still traces of life out on the streets, ravaged as they were. They gave you some idea of what had been."
    },
    {
        "text": "Unlike the total annihilation back there."
    },
    {
        "text": "Like, for example..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Those two kids. Kids painstakingly raising their weapons."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Devil! What are you doing here?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unyielding Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "N-no, don't provoke her...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waifish Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "S-sorry... we were just leaving...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waifish Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's an army sword you're holding, isn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, it is. Sarkaz steel... You can't even lift it. Why are you hauling that thing around?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "You gonna fight back? You gonna kill me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eeep\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waifish Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "G-get back\u2014\u2014agh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unyielding Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rublev... your leg!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waifish Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, you're hurt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're gonna get infected. This city got hit with a Catastrophe. It's not safe here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't turn into a thing like you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unyielding Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aww. What a tough kid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me ask you\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014Do you know what it means to take up the blade of a fallen Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
